# Gallery / Archive albums

Album lists live in:

- Current year: `app/gallery/gallery-data.json` (`name`, `date`, `url`)
- Archive: `app/gallery/archive/archive-data.json` (`name`, `date`, `link` per event)

## Dates

Before adding or renaming an album, check the CSA Events calendar ICS:

https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/c_o0ntjuei84bjmlpfqbcsr62u3c%40group.calendar.google.com/public/basic.ics

- Set `date` as `M/D/YYYY` (same format as existing Archive rows), matching the calendar event.
- If the album is a recap / media dump with no calendar event, use `""`.
- If the matching event date is unclear, ask the user before writing a date. Do not guess.

## Drive links

- Do not invent Google Drive folder URLs.
- Ask the user for a shareable folder link (Anyone with the link → Viewer) if they have not provided one.
